    },
    "message": "Move the trace documents to Rust, and run traces and Providers on the driver\n\nThe kernels now write the psychology, contact and decision documents of a Run\nwith a trace (decision D1), in the same shape, through rules/trace.rs. The writer\nstays in Python. A router that can call a Provider, a trace of the engine's phases\nand a tick_probe also keep the driver, since their hooks already run where the\nphases run them. PhaseProfiler uses phase_observer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
